hde (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Build and install the complete desktop: desktop, panel, settings, files,
    media, terminal, widgets, NexWM, lock screen, idle handling, automount and
    keyring integration.
  * Install under /usr, as required by Debian policy.
  * Install the Wayland session only when layer-shell, Wayland and xkbcommon
    support were actually built.

